    "de": [
      "Hochwertiger, handwerklich hergestellter Essig, der mit Pflanzen aus der Region aromatisiert und in Eichenfässern gereift ist."
    ],
    "en": [
      "Local vinegars of quality, flavoured with local plants, aged in oak barrels. Spices and kitchenware.\r\nNew: the House of Pâté is located in the La Para Epices store."
    ],
